{"seq":3,"slug":"tutor-and-the-lyceum","title":"Tutor And The Lyceum","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/tutor-and-the-lyceum","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tutor-of-alexander","title":"亚历山大的老师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/tutor-and-the-lyceum/tutor-of-alexander","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-the-lyceum","title":"创立吕克昂","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/tutor-and-the-lyceum/founding-the-lyceum","wordCount":1648,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章追溯亚里士多德的帝师生涯与吕克昂的创立。他曾担任马其顿王子——后来的亚历山大大帝——的老师，这是&quot;智者与征服者&quot;的一次意味深长的交汇。约公元前335年，他重返雅典，创立了自己的学园&quot;吕克昂&quot;，建立了&quot;逍遥学派&quot;，开展了涵盖几乎所有领域的系统研究。本章呈现亚里士多德学术生涯巅峰期的人生历程。</p>\n"}